position_evaluator_system.output_format:
Return ONLY a valid JSON object matching this exact schema:
{
  "evaluations": [
    {
      "symbol": "TOKEN_SYMBOL",
      "health_status": "HEALTHY, WARNING, CRITICAL, or TIME_EXPIRED",
      "action": "HOLD_PATIENT, EMERGENCY_CLOSE, TIMEOUT_CLOSE, BREAK_EVEN_GUARD, or TIGHTEN_SL",
      "urgency": "HIGH, MEDIUM, or LOW",
      "diagnosis": "Concise 1-sentence explanation of market structure and PnL diagnosis.",
      "recommended_stop_loss": 0.0
    }
  ]
}
